            "notes": "[Lifelift](item_641c3e2b-d652-4dc6-9ab9-1e5307b78325) is the core of this build and received a 25% buff. 50% of the HP you gain from items is added to your bubbles HP.\n\n[Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) gives a 5% damage boost (attack speed translates 1:1 to damage on beams but increases ammo consumption). I usually take [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) for sustain, as the other items are generally not very effective. [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418) is the only other item I like in R1 since it provides movement speed.",
