            "notes": "[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) is our core damage item. [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) is arguably the best item in the game for its price \u2014 movement speed is especially valuable on Zarya. Keep the green items if possible.\n\nIf you can't afford [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054), you can opt for [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418) or an HP item like [Siphon Gloves](item_099f8177-c2a4-4e13-b321-99349f8b1eb7) or [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6), since they improve your bubble effectiveness.\n\nAgainst armor or shields (blue HP \u2014 **not** barriers), you can swap [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) for [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66).",
