            "notes": "[Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) for increased damage.\n\nIf you still have cash, I **highly recommend** replacing one of your green items with [Blastproof Boots](item_530190fc-db36-481e-9bd7-4a0a05c5e53d). It unlocks access to high ground, helps you escape and opens up more options.\n\nIf you're snowballing, you can skip [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) and go directly for [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) instead.\n\nOther alternatives to [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27):\n\n- **[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643)** works well against slower comps and also improves your bubble a bit. When running [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643), consider substituting [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) with [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) to gain 25% lifesteal.\n- You can also opt for **[Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8)** to bolster your durability and enhance your bubbles.",
