            "created_at": "2025-08-30T20:10:52.483039+00:00",
            "notes": "[Graviton Anomaly](item_ff57c3ea-a20b-47ce-85c0-82295ffbead4) is excellent\u2014you build ultimate charge much faster, and it lets you pin down high value targets like Kiriko or Mercy. Use it to get an opening pick on a target that you can easily kill with reduced grav durration.\n\n[Volskaya Vortex](item_4a24240a-a0b1-4a0e-83d1-acf8c5647b5b) shines against stationary comps. It still slows enemies even if you don't have AP for it to do real damage.\n\n[Pre\u2011Workout](item_cdfbf8ce-d7cc-4b31-9c59-8b65fcb7b158) pairs well with [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643), getting you to 25% lifesteal.\n\n[Here to Spot You](item_170b78de-4cbc-4b72-9efe-85ec58ac59ef) offers a solid 20% heal and added mobility\u2014it can help you reach high ground when needed.\n\nThis round, you're choosing between increasing damage or more survivability.\n\nIf you go for damage, take [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b).\n\nFor defense [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) is solid\u2014bubble cleanses the debuff and the added HP improves your bubble.\n\n[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) adds sustain, especially when paired with [Volskaya Vortex](item_4a24240a-a0b1-4a0e-83d1-acf8c5647b5b). [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) is also really effective in these situations.\n\nIf you have extra credits swap out [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) for either [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) or [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) to enhance your sustained output.",
