            "notes": "[Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) is solid in most games, since your bubble cleanses the negative effect and it makes your bubble better.\n\nIf you feel like you\u2019re ahead, consider going with [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) or [Bigger Beam](item_c29f5350-77e0-4bbb-a775-09bac9b10688). [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643)  is great versus sustained-composition fights where continuous beam damage helps you outlast opponents. [Bigger Beam](item_c29f5350-77e0-4bbb-a775-09bac9b10688) offers greater reach, letting you hit evasive targets like Juno, Mercy, Genji, or Freya.\n\nIf you\u2019re burning through ammo quickly, swap a green item for [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2). It increases attack speed by 5% and adds ammo.",
